Barry A. Wills and James A. Finch. Wills' Mineral Processing Technology: An Introduction to the Practical Aspects of Ore Treatment and Mineral Recovery, eighth edition, Butterworth-Heinemann/Elsevier. ISBN 9780080970530. [Publisher, edition, and complete contents](https://shop.elsevier.com/books/wills-mineral-processing-technology/wills/978-0-08-097053-0) · [Book DOI](https://doi.org/10.1016/C2010-0-65478-2).

The publisher gives a release date of 1 September 2015; some library/catalogue citations use 2016. Preserve the edition actually consulted. This is a commercial reference, available through purchase or an authorized library, rather than an open textbook. The main public progression uses CETEM and the university course.

For a further sustained English progression, read the complete book and solve its examples, then revisit full assigned chapters and appendices for balances, separation models, flotation kinetics, and scale-up. Publisher metadata and contents checked on 29 October 2026; access to the full commercial text is not claimed. All book material remains external.

